### VisQuill GDK Attribution & License Notice

This project incorporates and builds upon the visual design principles and
algorithms of **VisQuill GDK** (*Geometric Design Kit*), specifically the
paradigm of *Profiles along a line (A1 Collision Density)* for curvilinear road
profiling and linear referencing systems (LRS).

- Visualization of longitudinal profiles and parallel curvilinear extrusions
  is powered by **VisQuill GDK**.
- All rights and original methodology credits for VisQuill GDK belong to its
  respective authors and contributors.
- RoadSafetyScan provides this platform as free and open-source software (FOSS)
  to support municipal governments, regional authorities (GORE), provincial
  municipalities, transport agencies (SUTRAN, ATU, MTC), and civil engineering
  auditors in evaluating and improving road safety infrastructure.
